      "seed": 1832719818,
      "version": 164,
      "versionNonce": 1990514250,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1786525914571,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "It sets up the System Prompt Context containing rules on multi-tenant isolation,\ninstructions to fetch connected clients via get_connected_tenants when\norganization names are referred to, and formatting rules (such as hiding ugly raw\ndatabase UUIDs like paymentId or bankTransactionId from the main message\nbubbles).",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "It sets up the System Prompt Context containing rules on multi-tenant isolation, instructions to fetch connected clients via get_connected_tenants when organization names are referred to, and formatting rules (such as hiding ugly raw database UUIDs like paymentId or bankTransactionId from the main message bubbles).",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "0-4vIxeZTt6vISRGv0DPU",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 40.289157443576414,
